<%- include('partials/header') %>
<h1>往来对账</h1>
<div class="card"><h2>客户对账</h2><p class="muted">按实际入账日期核对销售、收款、退货和退款。逐笔记录从 <%= openingDate %> 开始，旧账在该日升级结转；草稿、待审核、已拒绝单据不入账。</p>
<form class="statement-selector" method="GET" action="/reconciliation/customers/0" data-statement-selector="customers"><div class="form-row"><label for="statementCustomer">客户</label><select id="statementCustomer" data-partner-id><option value="0">散客</option><% customers.forEach(function(c){ %><option value="<%= c.id %>"><%= c.name %></option><% }) %></select></div><div class="form-row"><label for="customerStart">开始日期</label><input id="customerStart" name="start" type="date" min="<%= openingDate %>" max="<%= end %>" value="<%= start %>" required></div><div class="form-row"><label for="customerEnd">结束日期</label><input id="customerEnd" name="end" type="date" max="<%= end %>" value="<%= end %>" required></div><button class="btn" type="submit">生成客户对账单</button></form></div>
<div class="card"><h2>供应商采购对账</h2><p class="muted">按采购日期核对入库单和采购金额。当前未记录供应商付款，因此采购金额不代表未付账款。</p><form class="statement-selector" method="GET" action="/reconciliation/suppliers/0" data-statement-selector="suppliers"><div class="form-row"><label for="statementSupplier">供应商</label><select id="statementSupplier" data-partner-id required><option value="">请选择</option><% suppliers.forEach(function(s){ %><option value="<%= s.id %>"><%= s.name %></option><% }) %></select></div><div class="form-row"><label for="supplierStart">开始日期</label><input id="supplierStart" name="start" type="date" value="<%= start %>" required></div><div class="form-row"><label for="supplierEnd">结束日期</label><input id="supplierEnd" name="end" type="date" max="<%= end %>" value="<%= end %>" required></div><button class="btn" type="submit">生成采购对账单</button></form></div>
<script src="/statementSelect.js?v=1" defer></script>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
